==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Flashfire|Druddigon|70}} from the {{TCG|Flashfire}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Dragon Claw}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Druddigon}} can learn.
*{{a|Rough Skin}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Druddigon}} can have.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

